    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Bayou Vista first appeared as an unincorporated place in the 1970 U.S. Census.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayou_Vista%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town sits at 29°41′26″N 91°16′9″W, roughly 29.69 degrees north and 91.26 degrees west.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayou_Vista%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Originally a fishing and oil‑service hub, Bayou Vista remains tied to maritime industries, with nearby ports supporting offshore energy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.trawellino.com/destinations/united-states/louisiana_bayou-vista"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The community lies within the Mississippi Delta’s low‑lying wetlands, facing hurricane risks while offering bayou fishing and Cajun cultural sites.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.trawellino.com/destinations/united-states/louisiana_bayou-vista"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Bayou Vista is part of the Morgan City Micropolitan Statistical Area, linking it to the regional economy.",
